1	// Acceptance test for the change request:
2	//   "Give me one place that lists all my invoices from every project. Show which project each one
3	//    is for. Show what stage it is at."
4	//
5	// A NEW page (invoices-page), reachable from the nav (nav-invoices), lists EVERY invoice in the
6	// app in ONE place — invoices from every project, not scoped to a single project the way the
7	// project detail page is. Each invoice is shown with WHICH PROJECT it is for (invoice-project,
